# This directory also holds unrelated projects/assets alongside the actual
# Next.js app (a separate Remotion video project, raw asset dumps, zips) —
# excluded here so the deploy upload stays scoped to the site itself. Every
# entry is anchored to the repo root (`/`) — unanchored `IMAGES/` also
# matched `public/images/` and silently dropped every real site photo from
# the deploy (confirmed live: /images/*.jpeg 404'd).
